WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:17.513
Mandy and Twi joined some women, who greeted Mandy with smiles.

2
00:00:18.974 --> 00:00:22.576
Twi gave Mandy a cloth bag to hang over her shoulder.

3
00:00:22.596 --> 00:00:26.418
"You put the nuts in here," said Twi.

4
00:00:27.979 --> 00:00:30.080
The women headed off into the bushes.

5
00:00:31.504 --> 00:00:34.725
Mandy looked for Vinnie, but he had already left.

6
00:00:36.386 --> 00:00:40.468
The women and girls reached some tall trees and then split up.

7
00:00:41.748 --> 00:00:45.930
Each woman worked under a tree, collecting the nuts on the ground.

8
00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:52.573
"I'll be over there," grinned Twi, pointing to a nearby tree.

9
00:00:52.593 --> 00:00:57.475
"Wait! What do the nuts look like?"

10
00:00:58.095 --> 00:00:58.875
cried Mandy.

11
00:00:58.895 --> 00:01:04.799
"Look," smiled Twi, as she picked up an egg-shaped nut.

12
00:01:04.819 --> 00:01:07.601
"This is the mongongo."

13
00:01:09.022 --> 00:01:12.425
Then Twi left Mandy to gather the strange nuts.

14
00:01:12.445 --> 00:01:19.911
"Well," thought Mandy, "at least I'm not doing anything horrible like hunting."

15
00:01:21.612 --> 00:01:26.817
Meanwhile, Vinnie was watching Kashe as he reached into a small cloth bag.

16
00:01:26.837 --> 00:01:32.005
"Pay attention," said Kashe, holding up an arrow.

17
00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:34.726
"We will add the poison now."

18
00:01:36.066 --> 00:01:38.767
"Poison?" asked Vinnie, nervously.

19
00:01:38.787 --> 00:01:42.729
"Hold this arrow, Vinnie," said Kashe.

20
00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.130
Vinnie held the arrow carefully.

21
00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:53.113
"These are beetle larvae," explained Kashe, holding up some small yellow things.

22
00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:55.714
"They contain poison."

23
00:01:57.175 --> 00:01:59.716
He squeezed some liquid from one larva.

24
00:02:01.084 --> 00:02:02.625
Then he put it on the arrow.

25
00:02:02.645 --> 00:02:08.049
"We shoot the animal and the poison goes into the blood," said Kashe.

26
00:02:08.069 --> 00:02:11.211
"Soon, the animal dies."

27
00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:15.594
Another man named Gau came running up.

28
00:02:15.614 --> 00:02:19.697
"We have spotted the birds," he said.

29
00:02:19.717 --> 00:02:22.238
"Do you shoot birds?"

30
00:02:22.779 --> 00:02:23.459
asked Vinnie.

31
00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:25.901
Kashe shook his head.

32
00:02:25.921 --> 00:02:30.264
"Birds circle in the sky above a dying animal.

33
00:02:31.392 --> 00:02:33.553
We are close to an animal we shot yesterday.

34
00:02:34.853 --> 00:02:36.934
We must go and carry it back to the village."

35
00:02:38.855 --> 00:02:43.217
Meanwhile, Mandy was thinking that picking nuts wasn't much fun.

36
00:02:43.237 --> 00:02:46.798
"Mandy, how many have you got?"

37
00:02:47.298 --> 00:02:48.679
Twi walked over to her.

38
00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:52.741
Twi's bag was overflowing with nuts.

39
00:02:53.481 --> 00:02:54.981
Mandy only had a few.

40
00:02:55.001 --> 00:02:59.543
"How did you get so many so fast?"

41
00:03:00.404 --> 00:03:01.104
asked Mandy.

42
00:03:02.668 --> 00:03:07.750
"We learn how to pick mongongo nuts when we are very young," said Twi, grinning.

43
00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:11.332
"Watch!" She bent down.

44
00:03:11.792 --> 00:03:14.613
Her hands moved quickly back and forth on the ground.

45
00:03:16.014 --> 00:03:20.516
Then she stood up, smiled, and used only her toes to pick up a nut.

46
00:03:22.036 --> 00:03:23.937
Mandy laughed and clapped her hands.

47
00:03:23.957 --> 00:03:27.278
"That's amazing!"

48
00:03:28.859 --> 00:03:32.914
The other women gathered together and emptied their bags on the ground.

49
00:03:32.934 --> 00:03:35.536
"The nuts are heavy.

50
00:03:35.856 --> 00:03:39.159
So we crack the shells off here," explained Twi.

51
00:03:39.179 --> 00:03:43.322
"Then our bags are much lighter for the journey home."

52
00:03:43.342 --> 00:03:45.704
"Good idea!"

53
00:03:46.305 --> 00:03:46.985
said Mandy.

54
00:03:47.005 --> 00:03:53.211
"Oh, while we're here," Twi said, "I want to show you something."

55
00:03:54.672 --> 00:03:57.074
Mandy followed Twi to a small cave.

56
00:03:58.575 --> 00:04:02.009
At the opening, they found a rock with some paintings on it.

57
00:04:02.029 --> 00:04:07.272
"These are drawings my ancestors made," said Twi.

58
00:04:08.513 --> 00:04:10.574
"They tell a story about our people."

59
00:04:11.995 --> 00:04:15.337
Mandy could see animals and dancing men on the rock.

60
00:04:16.517 --> 00:04:18.598
The men had animal features too.

61
00:04:19.979 --> 00:04:20.900
Some had horns.

62
00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:23.041
Others had lion's legs.

63
00:04:23.061 --> 00:04:27.123
"This is the object in the photo!"

64
00:04:27.723 --> 00:04:28.604
shouted Mandy.

65
00:04:29.972 --> 00:04:30.833
"What do you mean?"

66
00:04:31.474 --> 00:04:32.194
cried Twi.

67
00:04:33.636 --> 00:04:35.878
"So why am I still here?"

68
00:04:36.718 --> 00:04:37.459
thought Mandy.
